During the October 10th moves, my short position closed nicely in profit, while the long position was stopped out. You can review the quoted analysis for full context &amp; previous predictions.

</span><a data-state="closed" data-slot="hover-card-trigger" class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-brand text-[length:inherit] font-normal hover:underline" href="https://x.com/search?q=$ETCUSDT">$<!-- -->ETCUSDT</a><span class="font-chirp max-w-full whitespace-pre-wrap break-words text-inherit text-[length:inherit] font-inherit">:
A reclaim of the blue box could reflect positively on price.
